Subject: [PATCH 06/18] feat(board): large team-coloured score panels with
 in-control/banked/steal status

Team columns go from 192px to 300px, names sit in a team-coloured header above
the score, and a status pill shows who buzzed in first, who banked the round
(+N) or who can steal. Phone view uses a compact variant.
